# living-docs (standing)

Follow the installed **living-docs** skill.

When the user corrects a mistake, the same class of mistake repeats, verify-work finds a gap, or you place a new agent artifact: same-turn anti-patterns **only if they will probably repeat** (default skip — no upstream forensics / pins / “don’t delete the fix”). Prefer strengthen/merge. Linter bans when mechanical. Reply strengthened vs added, or skipped.
